130
00:09:47,846 --> 00:09:51,846
But with all the storms and pirates everywhere, it's near impossible.

131
00:09:51,846 --> 00:09:54,846
The shipyards are starting to get so desperate for customers,

132
00:09:54,846 --> 00:09:57,346
they are literally fighting each other for them.

133
00:09:57,346 --> 00:09:59,846
So many have closed down already.

134
00:09:59,846 --> 00:10:05,846
At this rate, Water 7 is on a course to sink into the ocean and fade from the world's memory.

135
00:10:05,846 --> 00:10:11,346
And to think, this city made its name, making unforgettable, unsinkable ships such a shame.

136
00:10:11,346 --> 00:10:15,346
Hey, you built a big super awesome pirate ship once now, didn't you, Tom?

137
00:10:15,346 --> 00:10:18,346
