142
00:10:31,846 --> 00:10:34,846
And a seagull flag means that it's navy.

143
00:10:34,846 --> 00:10:37,846
Whatever you build, just remember this.

144
00:10:37,846 --> 00:10:39,846
Build it with pride.

145
00:10:39,846 --> 00:10:42,846
And a whole lot of manly gusto!

146
