A mobile court.

167
00:11:31,566 --> 00:11:32,706
I wonder who they're here for.

168
00:11:38,346 --> 00:11:39,926
What do you think you're doing?

169
00:11:40,306 --> 00:11:42,066
Let him go, you big stupid jerk.

170
00:11:42,166 --> 00:11:43,606
He didn't do anything wrong!

171
00:11:43,646 --> 00:11:44,666
Don't you worry!

172
00:11:44,846 --> 00:11:46,426
I'll be just fine.

173
00:11:50,026 --> 00:11:51,066
No, Tom!

174
00:11:51,366 --> 00:11:52,406
Come back!

175
00:12:00,586 --> 00:12:03,566
Justice was brought to Gold Roger, the king of the pirates,

176
00:12:03,686 --> 00:12:04,766
by way of execution.

177
00:12:05,286 --> 00:12:06,626
His ship, the Oro Jackson,

178
00:12:06,926 --> 00:12:08,386
was built by none other than Tom,

179
00:12:08,506 --> 00:12:10,066
who stands before this court today.

180
00:12:10,506 --> 00:12:13,306
As penalty for aiding and abetting that vicious criminal,

181
00:12:13,306 --> 00:12:15,286
Tom will be taken to Eni's lobby,

182
00:12:15,426 --> 00:12:16,606
where he will be executed.

183
