They say it's because he built a ship for the king of the pirates.

188
00:12:42,206 --> 00:12:42,846
Damn shame.

189
00:12:43,346 --> 00:12:46,166
That thing brought a whole lot of grief into the world.

190
00:12:46,886 --> 00:12:48,746
Now, building ships is not a crime,

191
00:12:48,966 --> 00:12:51,906
and one may sell them to almost anyone who wishes to buy,

192
00:12:52,046 --> 00:12:54,846
but we must make an exception for the king of the pirates.

193
00:12:54,846 --> 00:13:00,166
On the charge of providing meaningful assistance to the man who terrorized the entire world,

194
00:13:00,306 --> 00:13:02,506
we hereby sentence Tom to death.

195
00:13:02,946 --> 00:13:03,926
Take him away!

196
00:13:03,926 --> 00:13:06,806
Come on, time to go.

197
