204
00:13:17,146 --> 00:13:20,006
A train that will run on the surface of the ocean with gusto!

205
00:13:21,226 --> 00:13:22,106
Shut up!

206
00:13:22,366 --> 00:13:23,006
Get moving!

207
00:13:23,966 --> 00:13:26,606
This once great island has lost its gusto.

208
00:13:26,946 --> 00:13:28,986
Our trade is not what it used to be.

209
00:13:29,386 --> 00:13:30,666
People have lost hope.

210
00:13:30,666 --> 00:13:33,886
Water 7 is slowly sinking away.

211
00:13:34,426 --> 00:13:37,826
Every day, our hard-working citizens are filled with worry.

212
00:13:38,266 --> 00:13:39,786
I can lift their spirits!

213
00:13:40,306 --> 00:13:41,126
I will!

214
00:13:41,586 --> 00:13:44,326
By building our good people a sea train!

215
00:13:46,746 --> 00:13:49,386
Quit flapping your gums and move your feet!

216
00:13:49,506 --> 00:13:50,466
No, let him stay.

217
00:13:51,546 --> 00:13:52,706
Sea train.

218
00:13:53,366 --> 00:13:54,346
Tell me more.

219
00:13:54,786 --> 00:13:55,826
It's like a ship,

220
00:13:56,466 --> 00:13:59,306
but one that puffs out steam and runs on a track.

221
00:13:59,306 --> 00:14:01,026
It'll go between the islands,

222
00:14:01,166 --> 00:14:03,306
carrying people and all kinds of goods,

223
00:14:03,606 --> 00:14:04,626
even other ships.

224
00:14:05,086 --> 00:14:05,926
Most importantly,

225
00:14:06,046 --> 00:14:08,106
it won't be affected by conditions at sea.

226
00:14:08,306 --> 00:14:09,306
That's ridiculous!

227
00:14:10,266 --> 00:14:12,406
A railway on the water will be ripped to pieces

228
00:14:12,406 --> 00:14:14,066
once Aqualaguna comes around.

229
00:14:14,126 --> 00:14:15,226
And even if it doesn't,

230
00:14:15,306 --> 00:14:17,646
what are you gonna do about all the sea kings out there?

231
00:14:18,006 --> 00:14:20,146
It doesn't have to be a completely fixed track.

232
00:14:20,366 --> 00:14:20,626
Huh?

233
00:14:21,046 --> 00:14:23,266
It'll be submerged under the water a bit,

234
00:14:23,466 --> 00:14:25,546
so it won't be bombarded by the waves.

235
00:14:25,726 --> 00:14:28,046
It'll sway, just like a rope in the water.

236
00:14:28,046 --> 00:14:30,766
The sea train will just use the tracks as a guide

237
00:14:30,766 --> 00:14:32,186
to get from place to place.

238
00:14:32,546 --> 00:14:34,786
I'm also considering installing a mechanism

239
00:14:34,786 --> 00:14:37,406
that emits a loud, dissonant sound underwater

240
00:14:37,406 --> 00:14:40,146
to discourage fish from getting anywhere near the tracks.

241
00:14:40,586 --> 00:14:42,426
It should work on sea kings as well,

242
00:14:42,566 --> 00:14:43,746
so they won't pose a threat.

243
00:14:43,786 --> 00:14:45,186
Whoa, is all that possible?

244
00:14:46,086 --> 00:14:49,046
If we connect St. Poplar, Pucci, San Faldo,

245
00:14:49,286 --> 00:14:50,186
and this island,

246
00:14:50,466 --> 00:14:52,046
we can create a booming economy

247
00:14:52,046 --> 00:14:53,726
that will help out all of us.

248
00:14:54,426 --> 00:14:54,946
Amazing!

249
00:14:54,946 --> 00:14:58,066
I will be finished with the blueprints very soon,

250
00:14:58,326 --> 00:15:00,886
but it will take a master shipwright to build it.

251
00:15:01,026 --> 00:15:03,646
Now, could this sea train run to Annie's lobby as well?

252
00:15:03,826 --> 00:15:05,326
Without a doubt, Your Honor.

253
00:15:07,246 --> 00:15:09,086
Once the plans are in the can

254
00:15:09,086 --> 00:15:10,906
and the railway is in the water,

255
00:15:11,226 --> 00:15:13,546
people can go with gusto from island to island

256
00:15:13,546 --> 00:15:14,566
for work or play.

257
00:15:14,946 --> 00:15:16,086
And once again,

258
00:15:16,446 --> 00:15:18,906
Water 7 will be a city filled with hope!

259
00:15:19,786 --> 00:15:21,066
How long will it take?

260
00:15:21,566 --> 00:15:21,946
Ten years.

261
00:15:21,946 --> 00:15:23,746
Then build it.

262
00:15:24,486 --> 00:15:26,726
If you agree to develop this sea train,

263
00:15:26,946 --> 00:15:28,626
I will give you the time to do it.

264
00:15:28,826 --> 00:15:31,366
Consider these next ten years as probation.

265
00:15:33,526 --> 00:15:34,886
That's great news!

266
00:15:35,086 --> 00:15:36,206
Good luck, Tom!

267
00:15:37,006 --> 00:15:38,946
Save Water 7, please!

268
00:15:39,326 --> 00:15:42,706
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

269
00:15:42,906 --> 00:15:43,766
Ah, gusto!

270
00:15:44,226 --> 00:15:45,146
I'm alive!

271
00:15:45,366 --> 00:15:47,186
I'm glad you think this is so funny.

272
00:15:47,366 --> 00:15:48,586
I thought you were a goner.

273
00:15:48,586 --> 00:15:50,306
I was worried sick over you.

